# SpecShot mission

**SpecShot** is a macOS desktop app (Electron) for annotating screenshots with click-to-place notes, dashed arrows, and colored sidebar cards—then exporting a pixel-perfect Retina image or a structured `.zip`/`.speck` bundle for LLM intake.

Canonical mission text: `~/.cursor/skills/specshot-devkit/MISSION.md`

## After product changes

When export format, bundle schema, or core UX behavior changes meaningfully, ask once in one short line:

**Update SpecShot mission?**

If yes, update both `~/.cursor/skills/specshot-devkit/MISSION.md` and the **Mission** section at the top of `CLAUDE.md`.
